<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-George Weston yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-George Weston yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     81.75 vs 74.09</p>
<p>    Net					54.08 vs 51.53</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		8.0  vs  8.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     17.5  vs 17.5</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			 1.28 vs 1.13</p>
<p>    Other income			   17.92 vs 10.74</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    57.2  vs  54.5</p>
<p>NOTE: George Weston is 78 percent-owned by Associated British Foods Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
